OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1787730492
OL,3,CRugby league legend Sir Billy Boston
OL,4,Cdies aged 92
OL,6,FRugby league legend Sir Billy Boston
OL,7,Fhas died at the age of 92.
OL,9,FSir Billy scored 478 tries in 487
OL,10,Fmatches for Wigan after making the
OL,11,Fswitch from union to league in 1953.
OL,13,FThe Welsh winger, who was born in
OL,14,FCardiff, revealed he had been living
OL,15,Fwith vascular dementia in 2016.
OL,17,FHe died in hospital overnight on 24
OL,18,FAugust, just four days after the
OL,19,Ffuneral of his wife, Lady Joan, to
OL,20,Fwhom he had been married for 70 years.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/12
