OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1787730492
OL,3,CRugby league legend Sir Billy Boston
OL,4,Cdies aged 92
OL,6,FSir Billy played for Wigan between
OL,7,F1953 and 1968, and then went on to
OL,8,Fplay for Blackpool from 1969 to 1970.
OL,10,FHe scored a total of 571 tries in his
OL,11,Fcareer, making him the second-highest
OL,12,Ftry scorer in rugby league history.
OL,14,FAfter signing for Wigan, while still a
OL,15,Fteenager, for the price of #3,000, Sir
OL,16,FBilly went on to win the league
OL,17,Fchampionship and three Challenge Cup
OL,18,Ffinals.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/12
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1787730492
OL,3,CRugby league legend Sir Billy Boston
OL,4,Cdies aged 92
OL,6,FHe was awarded a knighthood in the
OL,7,FKing's Birthday Honours for services
OL,8,Fto rugby league and the community,
OL,9,Fafter a campaign led by former
OL,10,FMakerfield MP Josh Simons.
OL,12,FIt was the first time in rugby
OL,13,Fleague's 130-year history that one of
OL,14,Fits players had been knighted.
OL,16,FIn 2000, he was given the freedom of
OL,17,FWigan and has three statues, in Wigan,
OL,18,FWales and at Wembley Stadium.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/12
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1787730492
OL,3,CRugby league legend Sir Billy Boston
OL,4,Cdies aged 92
OL,6,FHis statue in Wigan is a solo bronze
OL,7,Fmonument in Believe Square, Wigan Town
OL,8,FCentre, which was unveiled in 2016.
OL,10,FThe Welsh 'Codebreakers' statue in
OL,11,FLandsea Square, Cardiff Bay features
OL,12,Ffellow Welsh rugby league players
OL,13,FClive Sullivan and Gus Risman. It was
OL,14,Fthe first statue in Wales to feature
OL,15,Fnon-fictionalised, named black men.
OL,17,FBorn in Tiger Bay, Cardiff, Sir Billy
OL,18,Falways wanted to play for Wales in
OL,19,Frugby union, but never had the chance
OL,20,Fto. He believes it was because he was
OL,21,Fnot white.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/12
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1787730492
OL,3,CRugby league legend Sir Billy Boston
OL,4,Cdies aged 92
OL,6,FInternationally, he won the World Cup
OL,7,Fwith Great Britain and played 31 times
OL,8,Ffor the Lions, becoming the first
OL,9,Fblack person to tour Australia as part
OL,10,Fof a British sports team.
OL,12,FDespite his success at Wigan, Sir
OL,13,FBilly was surprised that he received a
OL,14,Fstatue, he said: "The players Wigan
OL,15,Fhas had, I can't put myself above any
OL,16,Fof them. But you know, I've enjoyed
OL,17,Fevery minute of being at Wigan.
OL,19,FHis wife, Lady Joan Boston, died in
OL,20,FJuly 2026. They had been married for
OL,21,F70 years.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/12
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
