PN,30406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1787730492
OL,3,CRugby league legend Sir Billy Boston
OL,4,Cdies aged 92
OL,6,FSir Billy said she always looked after
OL,7,Fhim after his dementia diagnosis.
OL,9,FReflecting on his time at Wigan in a
OL,10,Fprevious interview, he said: "When I
OL,11,Fwas playing rugby union, I could go
OL,12,Fand have a smoke for five minutes."
OL,14,FHe added: "When I came to Wigan, the
OL,15,Ffirst game I played the A team and the
OL,16,Fball was never out of my hands. I
OL,17,Fthought, 'what is this?'. It was
OL,18,Fbrilliant."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/12
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1787730492
OL,3,CRugby league legend Sir Billy Boston
OL,4,Cdies aged 92
OL,6,FOn his time at the club, he said: "It
OL,7,Fwas an honour and a privilege to play
OL,8,Ffor Wigan. If I had my time all over
OL,9,Fagain, I'd do exactly the same thing
OL,10,Fagain."
OL,12,FFollowing the news of his death, Wigan
OL,13,FWarriors said his legacy "on and off
OL,14,Fthe field will endure for eternity".
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/12
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1787730492
OL,3,CRugby league legend Sir Billy Boston
OL,4,Cdies aged 92
OL,6,FOwner Mike Danson said: "Billy Boston
OL,7,Fwas everybody's hero, including my
OL,8,FMum's. His achievements in rugby
OL,9,Fleague were extraordinary, and his
OL,10,Fknighthood was a fitting recognition
OL,11,Fof a career that brought great credit
OL,12,Fto Wigan and to the game.
OL,14,F"But Billy's legacy was not simply
OL,15,Fwhat he achieved. It was the humility
OL,16,Fwith which he carried it. Despite
OL,17,Feverything he accomplished, he
OL,18,Fremained a quiet, dignified and deeply
OL,19,Frespected man.
OL,26,@nD@YOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/12
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1787730492
OL,3,CRugby league legend Sir Billy Boston
OL,4,Cdies aged 92
OL,6,F"He leaves behind an example that will
OL,7,Fendure for generations. Our thoughts
OL,8,Fare with his family and those closest
OL,9,Fto him.
OL,11,F"A great man, and a true Wigan legend.
OL,12,FHe will be remembered with pride and
OL,13,Faffection."
OL,15,FPaying tribute to the sports star, the
OL,16,FWelsh Rugby Union said he was "one of
OL,17,Fthe best loved and most iconic figures
OL,18,Fin the history of Welsh sport".
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUuD@KO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G9/12
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30410
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1787730492
OL,3,CRugby league legend Sir Billy Boston
OL,4,Cdies aged 92
OL,6,FIt added it sent its "sincere
OL,7,Fcondolences to the family and friends
OL,8,Fof Sir Billy."
OL,10,FThe Wales Rugby League also (WRL) paid
OL,11,Ftribute to Sir Billy, calling him "one
OL,12,Fof the most humble, warm and gracious
OL,13,Fpeople you could ever meet".
OL,15,F"On behalf of everyone at Wales Rugby
OL,16,FLeague, I want to express our deepest
OL,17,Fcondolences to the family and loved
OL,18,Fones of Sir Billy Boston at this
OL,19,Fincredibly sad time," WRL chairman,
OL,20,FJames Davies, said.
OL,26,@wD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G10/12
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30411
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1787730492
OL,3,CRugby league legend Sir Billy Boston
OL,4,Cdies aged 92
OL,6,F"Sir Billy was quite simply a legend
OL,7,Fof rugby league and one of the
OL,8,Fgreatest sportsmen Wales has ever
OL,9,Fproduced.
OL,11,F"His achievements on the field speak
OL,12,Ffor themselves, but for those
OL,13,Ffortunate enough to have met Billy, it
OL,14,Fwas the man behind those achievements
OL,15,Fwho left an equally lasting impression.
OL,17,F"Despite everything he accomplished,
OL,18,Fhe remained one of the most humble,
OL,19,Fwarm and gracious people you could
OL,20,Fever meet.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G11/12
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30412
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1787730492
OL,3,CRugby league legend Sir Billy Boston
OL,4,Cdies aged 92
OL,6,F"For us in Wales, Sir Billy's legacy
OL,7,Fwill always be particularly special.
OL,8,FHe was a proud Welshman, a trailblazer
OL,9,Fwho broke down barriers and inspired
OL,10,Fgenerations.
OL,12,F"The path he helped create gave so
OL,13,Fmany others the belief that they too
OL,14,Fcould succeed at the very highest
OL,15,Flevel of our sport."
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G12/12
